{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名男子在英國一個野生動物公園（Yorkshire Wildlife Park）遭老虎襲擊後死亡。</p><p>當地警方表示，上周六（10日）下午1時35分接報，有人闖入老虎活動區域，遭老虎襲擊，當場喪生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T03:18:16.452140+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T02:39:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035667+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"100d85fd1fb92042dabacdf8cf46bbcade684eb2a33ba8698ef6d6b8a2b0864f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}